From 0176c45d289c720557a66d74a7fd16c62ee9a544 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:55:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: only overlays that ask hide; a shop counts standing,
 3 min at most

Patch 0046 hid every plugin overlay outside the open world and at shops,
the Closet's (made for the shop), the Radio's and the video overlay too.
Now an overlay hides only where its manifest asks (ui.overlay.hideIn:
"dungeon", "games", "arena", "shop"; the Map's and the Limits'), unless
the player set it otherwise in Settings.

A merchant's list counts as a shop opened only with the player standing
(no movement step for 1.5 s), a list heard again doesn't start the count
of steps anew, and the shop ends after 3 minutes at the latest: the
overlays didn't come back after a shop.
